                : 'The gaming space where you can showcase your talent and compete for free in tournaments for your favorite games. In this Arena, your talent pays off: sign up, compete, and you could win cash prizes.'}
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full flex justify-center md:justify-end">
